    "title": "AI Full Stack Developer",
    "ciphertext": "~022078984132679540938",
    "description": "SkylarAI is looking for an experienced AI Full Stack Developer to help us build and improve intelligent software products. We are working on AI-powered solutions that combine modern web technologies with advanced automation, and we need someone who can take ideas from concept to production.\n\nIn this role, you will work across the entire application stack, including frontend interfaces, backend services, databases, APIs, and AI integrations. You will help build features powered by large language models, create smooth user experiences, and develop reliable systems that can scale as our products grow.\n\nWe are looking for someone who enjoys solving challenging technical problems and is comfortable working with both traditional software engineering and emerging AI technologies. You should have experience building full-stack applications and a strong understanding of how to connect AI models with real-world products.\n\nExperience with technologies like React, Next.js, Node.js, Python, OpenAI APIs, LangChain, vector databases, and cloud platforms is highly valuable. We are not looking for someone who only follows instructions — we want a developer who can think independently, suggest better approaches, and help shape the future direction of our products.\n\nIf you enjoy building innovative AI applications, experimenting with new technologies, and seeing your work directly impact users, we would love to hear from you.",
